      "repair_reason": "- [P1] The remaining merge gate is contributor-provided real CLI behavior evidence plus ordinary maintainer confirmation of the format-wide compatibility boundary, not an automated repair task.; Cleared: The supplied two-file diff uses built-in Node filesystem APIs only and introduces no dependency, workflow, permission, secret, or supply-chain change. (sha=68376d2cc32b1a213055166c0d2a5b0c37530fda)",
      "review_summary": "The PR replaces oc-path CLI reads in AST loading and `set --diff` with a descriptor-bound, chunked 16 MiB reader and updates the oversized-file diagnostic test.\n\nPR surface: Source +52, Tests 0. Total +52 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: no. live current-main reproduction was run in this read-only review, but the supplied diff identifies two unbounded user-path reads and routes both through the new bounded helper, making the source path reproducible with medium confidence.",
